ings.\nImproved: Filter Notifications (Now works 100% accurately)\nImproved: Liquid Glass performance and stability.\nRemoved: All the experimental options.\nRemoved: Built-in backup file for better experience.\n\n\nRelease Date: 29/08/2026\nCracked Date: 18/09/2026\nBase: 435.0.0.37.76\nVersion: 7.2 (Bugs Fixed)\nCracked: By Wagg13 - 1x\"\n\nAdded: Pick Instants from Gallery. (Premium)\nAdded: Download Photo/Video from Instants. (Premium)\nAdded: Send Audio as Voice Note — Pick any audio file from local storage and send as voice note in DMs. (Premium)\nAdded: Liquid Glass UI in Navigation Tabs.\nAdded: Change Like Animation Styles.\nAdded: Option to Download GIF / Image in Comments.\nAdded: Image to Text (OCR) in Comments — Extracts text from any images instantly with highest accuracy. (Premium)\nFixed: Mark as Seen.\nFixed: Hide Chat.\nFixed: Fonts and Emojis in Chats.\nFixed: Story looping issues (Not going to next).\nFixed: Reels Overflow menu issues.\nFixed: Search tab icon.\nFixed: Explore tab icon.\nImproved: Some flags issues.\n\n\nRelease Date: 12/7/2026\nBase: 435.0.0.37.76\nVersion: 7.1 (Beta 1)\n\n\nAdded: InstaPrime Options icon in Stories.\nAdded: Option to Hide 'InstaPrime Options' icon from stories.\nAdded: Option to Hide 'Mark as Seen' icon from stories.\nAdded: Long Press for InstaPrime Options – Simply long press on any post to quickly access InstaPrime options menu.\nAdded: Long Press for InstaPrime Options (Beta) – Simply long press on any story to quickly access InstaPrime options menu.\nAdded: Option to Enable / Disable Long Press for InstaPrime Options in Post / Stories.\nFixed: Enhance Photo Quality Crashes.\nFixed: Reels Crashes.\nFixed: DMs Crashes.\nFixed: Some Random Crashes.\n\n\nRelease Date: 7/7/2026\nBase: 435.0.0.37.76\nVersion: 7.0 (Base Updated)\n\n\nAdded: Image to Text (OCR) — Extracts text from any images instantly with highest accuracy. (Premium)\nAdded: DND Mode (Reels) — DND Mode automatically turns on when you start watching Reels and turns off when you leave. Enjoy your Reels without calls, notifications, or other distractions. (Premium)\nAdded: Add Custom Story Fonts — You can now add unlimited custom story fonts.\nAdded: Separate \"Mark as Seen\" option for stories — You can now manually mark specific stories as seen, when Ghost Mode is enabled.\nAdded: Voice Note Downloader — You can now download voice notes directly from DMs.\nAdded: Watch History. (Post, Story, Reel, Profile)\nAdded: App Language Support (English, Arabic, Hindi, Turkish, Portuguese (Brazil), Indonesian, Russian, Spanish).\nAdded: Detailed Profile Stats — Shows exact follower and following numbers and lets you know whether an account is Public or Private.\nAdded: Download Cover Photo.\nAdded: Disable Chat List Options — Hides long-press options from the chat list (Hide Filter Notification, Hide Chats, Mark as Seen, etc).\nAdded: Option to Download Update from Telegram and Official Website, instead of just Telegram.\nFixed: Login Issues (Incorrect password, The password that you've entered is incorrect. Please try again.)\nFixed: Show Follow Indicator in User Profiles, Now works accurately.\nFixed: Multiple Direct icons from top action bar and bottom navigation tabs.\nFixed: Carousel Downloader (Slides) — You can download the exact photo or video you want from a carousel instead of always getting the first item.\nFixed: Enhance Photo / Story Upload Quality.\nFixed: Disable Reel Scrolling.\nFixed: Ghost Mode was not working in menu toggle.\nFixed: Export Developer Configs bugs.\nFixed: Download Failed issues in some devices.\nFixed: Minor UI Glitches in InstaPrime Settings.\nFixed: Storage permission is no longer requested at startup — storage permission is requested only when you use a feature that needs it.\nFixed: Hidden Mention UI glitches.\nFixed: Random Crashes.\nFixed: Minor heating issues.\nRemoved: The \"Long Press to access InstaPrime Settings\" tooltip message from Home screen.\nFree: Show Follow Indicator in User Profiles (Mutual, Following, Follower).\n\n\nRelease Date: 1/5/2026\nBase: 422.0.0.44.64\nVersion: 6.2 (Bugs Fixed)\n\nAdded: Set Story Ring Size.\nAdded: New Downloads Options — Disable Subfolders, Skip Downloaded Media, Clear Download List.\nFixed: App Open Crashes (All Samsung Fold Phones, Xiaomi, Realme, Oppo, Vivo, OnePlus etc).\nFixed: Premium Activation on some devices.\nFixed: Story Crashes.\nFixed: Download Crash issues.\nFixed: Change Download Path issues.\nImproved: UI/UX.\nImproved: Performance.\nMisc: Enabled Pitch Black Theme.\nFree: Disable Group Creation When Sharing — Prevents from showing the 'Create Group' option when sharing posts, reels, or messages with multiple people.\n\n\nRelease Date: 3/4/2026\nBase: 422.0.0.44.64\nVersion: 6.1 (Base Updated)\n\nAdded: Creative Fonts for DMs — You can send stylish text using cool fonts in your DMs, It makes your messages look unique and stand out from others. (Premium)\nAdded: App Startup Tab — Choose which tab should open automatically when you start the app.\nAdded: Reorder Navigation Tabs — Long Press and Drag to reorder navigation tabs. Toggle to show/hide tabs.\nAdded: Choose WhatsApp Type — You can choose WhatsApp or WhatsApp Business based on what you need. Note: This option is only for reposting to your WhatsApp Story.\nAdded: New iOS 26.4 Emoji.\nFixed: Fonts and Emojis — Now you'll able to load .ttf file from Local Storage.\nFixed: Random Crashes.\nFixed: Story Crashes.\nFixed: Hidden Mentions.\nFixed: Hide Chats.\nFixed: Copy Comments issues.\nFixed: Download issues.\nFixed: UI/UX.\nImproved: Ghost Mode.\nImproved: Performance.\n\n\nRelease Date: 20/2/2026\nBase: 416.0.0.47.66\nVersion: 6.0 (Base Updated)\n\nAdded: View Blocked Profiles Secretly. (Premium)\n       — Posts: View and Download.\n       — Stories: View, Download and See Hidden Mentions.\n       — Highlights: View, Download and See Hidden Mentions.\n       — Much more: Coming Soon.\nAdded: Mark as Seen after Reply (DMs) — T