r Style (InstaPrime Settings > Miscellaneous > Change Mention Indicator Style).\nAdded: Option to 'Restart App' in Menu.\nAdded: Copy Selected Comment in Comment Section.\nImproved: iOS Emojis in Comments, Now iOS Emoji works on whole app.\nImproved: Set Background Image Performance.\nFixed: Some UI related bugs.\nFixed: App Crashes.\n\n\nRelease Date: 14/09/2025\nBase: 396.0.0.46.242\nVersion: 3.0 (Base Updated)\n\nAdded: Story Upload Time Tracker — You can view the exact upload time of stories in HH:MM:SS format (Hours:Minutes:Seconds).\nAdded: Option to Single Tap on (Hidden Mention) in stories to view all Mentions.\nAdded: '.json' Support in Developer Options.\nAdded: Focus Mode (Hide Stories, Feeds, Reels, Explore and all Comments).\nAdded: Disable Storage Permission.\nAdded: Long Press on Top Left corner (InstaPrime Logo) to get all the Settings.\nAdded: Option to Hide 'InstaPrime Options' icon from Reels.\nImproved: Disable Ads.\nImproved: App Performance.\nFixed: iOS Emojis in some parts of app.\nFixed: App Icon (Now Supports Material You Theme).\nFixed: Some UI related bugs.\nFixed: App Crashes.\n\n\nRelease Date: 7/08/2025\nBase: 391.0.0.42.82\nVersion: 2.0 (Base Updated)\n\nAdded: Hide all Home Options Icon from Home Screen (To access Home Options — Long Press on Home Button in Home Screen — InstaPrime Settings, Ghost Mode, Long Video Splitter, Dark Mode, Developer Options).\nAdded: Disable Suggested Reels.\nImproved: Emoji and Fonts.\nImproved: Ghost Modes.\nFixed: Calling issues.\nFixed: Some UI glitches.\nFixed: Major bugs like randomly crashing in some devices.\n\n\nRelease Date: 15/07/2025\nBase: 384.0.0.46.83\nVersion: 1.1 (Bugs Fixed)\n\nAdded: Dark/Light Mode.\nAdded: Options to Hide Home icons like (Video Splitter, Ghost Mode, Dark/Light Mode).\nAdded: Option to Enable Default Story Fonts.\nAdded: Option to Enable Replay Story.\nFixed: Emoji and Fonts.\nFixed: Repost to IG Post, IG Story and WhatsApp Story.\nFixed: Developer Options also Improved